/* The curling HUD in the new look (concept area C, curling_hud: 281-290). The plates, the digits, the start sign, the
   gauge and the hand are the original's pictures; the question and hint box is the story's speech box
   (story_textbox/style). The look styles the recruit bar under it (90,664 786 x 54): half a window with brackets,
   two lines in the small 1x type, your lead in green and a perfect round in gold. */

#recruit {
	padding: 4dp 18dp;
	border: 3dp transparent;
	border-radius: 0;
	background-color: transparent;
	decorator: image(nb-brk-tl scale-none left top) border-box, image(nb-brk-br scale-none right bottom) border-box,
		ninepatch(nb-half-outer, nb-half-inner, 1) border-box;
	font-family: "Pixel Body";
	font-size: 15dp;
	line-height: 22dp;
	color: #f2f0e1;
}

.recruit-line {
	height: 22dp;
}

#recruit-perfect {
	color: #efc63c;
}

#recruit.ahead #recruit-standing {
	color: #5fd36a;
}
